1
00:00:09,270 --> 00:00:10,350
(Passenger Drop-off Area)

2
00:00:36,330 --> 00:00:39,350
=Vow of Autumn=
=Episode 5=

3
00:00:39,760 --> 00:00:41,380
Who could possibly

4
00:00:41,820 --> 00:00:44,500
make Dr. Pei smile like that?

5
00:00:50,360 --> 00:00:51,840
She's a wonderful person.

6
00:00:52,720 --> 00:00:54,120
I've had feelings for her for years.

7
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:57,800
The line for these tarts keeps growing.

8
00:00:58,080 --> 00:00:59,360
Yeah, they're so good.

9
00:00:59,360 --> 00:01:00,440
I'm going again tomorrow.

10
00:01:09,940 --> 00:01:10,740
Who's that?

11
00:01:11,120 --> 00:01:12,080
My brother.

12
00:01:12,620 --> 00:01:13,820
My young stepmom's son.

13
00:01:14,620 --> 00:01:15,480
Don't say that.

14
00:01:15,480 --> 00:01:16,660
Kids are sensitive.

15
00:01:16,900 --> 00:01:18,700
It's fine. He's well-behaved.

16
00:01:18,700 --> 00:01:19,400
Good grades, too.

17
00:01:19,540 --> 00:01:19,960
Let's go.

18
00:01:30,660 --> 00:01:31,580
Hi there.

19
00:01:31,640 --> 00:01:32,680
I'm Wen Wanqing.

20
00:01:32,920 --> 00:01:34,040
I'm your sister's classmate

21
00:01:34,040 --> 00:01:35,240
and her best friend.

22
00:01:35,320 --> 00:01:36,240
Nice to meet you.

23
00:01:41,960 --> 00:01:43,400
This is our favorite.

24
00:01:43,400 --> 00:01:44,200
Here's one for you.

25
00:01:47,080 --> 00:01:48,100
I'll leave it here.

26
00:01:49,580 --> 00:01:50,620
Wait for me!

27
00:01:59,920 --> 00:02:00,720
But...

28
00:02:01,360 --> 00:02:02,080
she doesn't know.

29
00:02:05,100 --> 00:02:07,380
For you to say that, Dr. Pei,

30
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:08,720
she must be special.

31
00:02:09,000 --> 00:02:09,580
Good luck!

32
00:02:21,510 --> 00:02:22,550
(City Central Hospital
Inpatient Record)

33
00:02:22,550 --> 00:02:22,830
(Criminal Defense Engagement Contract)

34
00:02:32,600 --> 00:02:33,160
Ms. Wen.

35
00:02:34,240 --> 00:02:36,280
These are extra files for the Zhao case.

36
00:02:37,800 --> 00:02:38,700
They include

37
00:02:38,700 --> 00:02:40,360
asset custody details for affiliates.

38
00:02:43,930 --> 00:02:44,550
(IV. Risk assessment)

39
00:02:44,550 --> 00:02:47,630
(Zhou Ze, project manager)

40
00:02:51,350 --> 00:02:54,570
(Zhou Ze, project manager)

41
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:56,600
What's wrong?

42
00:02:56,860 --> 00:02:58,140
Is there a problem?

43
00:02:58,580 --> 00:02:59,920
Dingsheng Capital

44
00:03:00,020 --> 00:03:02,260
helps dispose of Zhao Group's assets?

45
00:03:02,460 --> 00:03:02,960
Yes.

46
00:03:03,280 --> 00:03:04,180
Zhao Group has

47
00:03:04,180 --> 00:03:06,240
share pledges and property disposals

48
00:03:06,440 --> 00:03:07,980
that require third-party involvement.

49
00:03:08,200 --> 00:03:10,360
Dingsheng is their long-term partner.

50
00:03:10,740 --> 00:03:12,120
This Mr. Zhou

51
00:03:12,280 --> 00:03:14,440
appears to be
a senior project manager there,

52
00:03:14,560 --> 00:03:15,700
in charge of this deal.

53
00:03:15,920 --> 00:03:16,600
Got it.

54
00:03:16,840 --> 00:03:18,360
Leave the other files there.

55
00:03:24,060 --> 00:03:25,680
(He just keeps haunting me.)

56
00:03:39,340 --> 00:03:40,620
This way, Ms. Wen.

57
00:04:10,360 --> 00:04:11,160
Wanqing.

58
00:04:12,840 --> 00:04:14,880
I know why you're here.

59
00:04:16,180 --> 00:04:18,100
Just a few fund transfers.

60
00:04:18,860 --> 00:04:19,960
One word from me,

61
00:04:20,680 --> 00:04:22,000
and it's taken care of.

62
00:04:25,040 --> 00:04:25,960
But...

63
00:04:28,080 --> 00:04:29,400
you have to make me happy

64
00:04:30,280 --> 00:04:31,240
before I can help you.

65
00:04:32,080 --> 00:04:32,800
Right?

66
00:04:33,660 --> 00:04:34,260
Mr. Zhou.

67
00:04:35,100 --> 00:04:36,240
I'm here on business.

68
00:04:37,520 --> 00:04:39,100
This is business.

69
00:04:40,740 --> 00:04:41,680
Here is

70
00:04:41,680 --> 00:04:42,620
my business:

71
00:04:44,100 --> 00:04:45,380
if you want my help,

72
00:04:46,540 --> 00:04:47,740
get back together with me.

73
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:53,180
Shall we?

74
00:05:42,140 --> 00:05:42,940
Ms. Li.

75
00:05:45,540 --> 00:05:45,880
Move.

76
00:05:46,780 --> 00:05:47,980
I've nothing to say to you.

77
00:05:48,280 --> 00:05:48,800
Li Xi.

78
00:05:49,940 --> 00:05:50,680
Let's team up.

79
00:05:52,340 --> 00:05:54,460
I made sure you saw this
today on purpose.

80
00:05:55,300 --> 00:05:56,060
He's not worth it.

81
00:05:56,740 --> 00:05:57,400
I can help you.

82
00:06:01,940 --> 00:06:02,980
How can you help me?

83
00:06:04,320 --> 00:06:05,160
Get a divorce?

84
00:06:06,140 --> 00:06:07,400
If we split up,

85
00:06:07,840 --> 00:06:09,560
he gets half my fortune.

86
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:11,760
I worked so hard to protect it.

87
00:06:12,000 --> 00:06:12,740
Why should he?

88
00:06:12,840 --> 00:06:15,140
Who says divorce means
you have to give him half?

89
00:06:15,940 --> 00:06:17,480
You work at the family firm.

90
00:06:18,020 --> 00:06:19,700
Pay yourself just a basic salary,

91
00:06:19,700 --> 00:06:21,020
enough for everyday expenses.

92
00:06:21,380 --> 00:06:22,900
Tie your bonuses and year-end payouts

93
00:06:22,900 --> 00:06:24,560
to the company's KPIs.

94
00:06:24,560 --> 00:06:26,200
Let the board control the assessment.

95
00:06:26,640 --> 00:06:28,040
In a divorce settlement,

96
00:06:28,040 --> 00:06:29,820
only recorded income counts.

97
00:06:30,240 --> 00:06:31,400
He won't get much.

98
00:06:31,860 --> 00:06:32,900
And your villa

99
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,920
is in your father's name, right?

100
00:06:35,580 --> 00:06:37,600
As the owner, your father

101
00:06:37,700 --> 00:06:39,460
can charge Zhou Ze market-rate rent.

102
00:06:40,060 --> 00:06:41,280
After all these years, why should he?

103
00:06:41,600 --> 00:06:42,880
When you married, that villa

104
00:06:42,880 --> 00:06:44,400
wasn't marital property.

105
00:06:44,400 --> 00:06:46,080
He won't get a cent of it.

106
00:06:46,300 --> 00:06:48,340
He'll even have to pay rent.

107
00:06:48,640 --> 00:06:49,560
More importantly,

108
00:06:49,680 --> 00:06:50,640
Zhou Ze cheated

109
00:06:50,800 --> 00:06:52,060
and used marital funds

110
00:06:52,060 --> 00:06:53,560
to buy gifts for me, his mistress.

111
00:06:53,980 --> 00:06:54,800
I can get evidence

112
00:06:54,800 --> 00:06:56,420
of all of that.

113
00:06:56,940 --> 00:06:57,960
By law,

114
00:06:58,300 --> 00:07:00,220
the innocent party can request
that he get less of the property,

115
00:07:00,780 --> 00:07:01,820
or nothing at all.

116
00:07:04,100 --> 00:07:05,480
You really know your stuff.

117
00:07:07,180 --> 00:07:07,980
I'm a lawyer.

118
00:07:08,560 --> 00:07:09,980
Finding solutions is my job.

119
00:07:10,760 --> 00:07:12,040
I'll let the paint thing go,

120
00:07:12,860 --> 00:07:14,540
and I can even win you a settlement

121
00:07:14,540 --> 00:07:15,980
that leaves him with nothing.

122
00:07:16,460 --> 00:07:17,340
You already know

123
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:19,560
you won't find

124
00:07:19,560 --> 00:07:20,740
a better lawyer for this.

125
00:07:28,020 --> 00:07:28,820
And in return?

126
00:07:30,920 --> 00:07:31,940
You'll know soon enough.

127
00:07:32,720 --> 00:07:33,360
Partners, then.

128
00:07:48,840 --> 00:07:49,840
Wen Wanqing!

129
00:07:50,060 --> 00:07:51,380
What did you tell Li Xi?

130
00:07:51,720 --> 00:07:53,080
Why is she suddenly helping you?

131
00:07:53,420 --> 00:07:53,980
Zhou Ze.

132
00:07:54,560 --> 00:07:55,960
I'm off the clock.

133
00:07:56,100 --> 00:07:57,040
For a consultation,

134
00:07:57,040 --> 00:07:58,800
book with reception tomorrow.

135
00:07:59,660 --> 00:08:00,260
Ms. Wen.

136
00:08:00,740 --> 00:08:01,940
So this is Zhou Ze,

137
00:08:02,180 --> 00:08:04,140
the jerk who hurt you?

138
00:08:06,260 --> 00:08:07,660
Give me those files.

139
00:08:09,300 --> 00:08:11,420
Do you really want me to say it here?

140
00:08:12,100 --> 00:08:13,520
You made up the transaction background

141
00:08:13,820 --> 00:08:15,900
to pass Dingsheng's money
through multiple accounts

142
00:08:16,120 --> 00:08:18,160
into your own shell company.

143
00:08:18,340 --> 00:08:20,760
I've traced every last bit of it.

144
00:08:21,180 --> 00:08:22,420
If you keep harassing me,

145
00:08:23,020 --> 00:08:24,120
I'll end your career

146
00:08:24,120 --> 00:08:25,000
in this field.

147
00:08:42,560 --> 00:08:43,880
You don't need to get your hands dirty.

148
00:08:54,300 --> 00:08:55,400
Want another one?

149
00:08:55,540 --> 00:08:56,180
Pei Yiqiu.

150
00:08:56,780 --> 00:08:57,220
Enough.

151
00:08:59,960 --> 00:09:01,220
Your hand's bleeding.

152
00:09:02,980 --> 00:09:04,400
It's fine. Just a scrape.

153
00:09:05,340 --> 00:09:06,840
Chen, we're heading out.

154
00:09:35,410 --> 00:09:37,270
(Passenger Drop-off Area)
